+# Activities
+
+Activities represent events that happened in the account across boards you have access to, such as cards being published, assigned, renamed, moved, triaged, closed, postponed, or commented on.
+
+## `GET /:account_slug/activities`
+
+Returns a paginated list of account activity accessible to the current user, ordered newest first.
+
+__Query Parameters:__
+
+| Parameter | Description |
+|-----------|-------------|
+| `creator_ids[]` | Filter by event creator user ID(s) |
+| `board_ids[]` | Filter by board ID(s) |
+
+__Included Actions:__
+
+`card_assigned`, `card_unassigned`, `card_published`, `card_closed`, `card_reopened`, `card_board_changed`, `card_title_changed`, `card_postponed`, `card_auto_postponed`, `card_triaged`, `card_sent_back_to_triage`, `comment_created`.
+
+__Particulars:__
+
+The `particulars` object contains event-specific details:
+
+- `card_assigned`, `card_unassigned`: `assignee_ids`
+- `card_board_changed`: `old_board`, `new_board`
+- `card_title_changed`: `old_title`, `new_title`
+- `card_triaged`: `column`
+- Other events: `{}`
+
+Missing `old_board`, `new_board`, `old_title`, `new_title`, or `column` values are returned as empty strings.
+
+__Response:__
+
